        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "As part of the Festival Accès Danse organized by the Quebec Association of Dance Teachers (AQÉDÉ), Myriam Allard will lead two flamenco workshops. Discover a unique kinesthetic approach combining grounding, verticality, body percussion and improvisation."
      },
